Elections Code. It is the opinion of the author(s), and has been printed exactly as submitted.
Vote YES on B – Repair and Upgrade Our Beaumont Unified Schools Without Increasing Taxes!
Our community continues to grow. Families choose to move and raise their families here due to our strong community
and public schools. The growing number of students has increased the demand and usage at our schools, and our oldest
schools are aging and are starting to show the wear and tear.
