Aging schools are built for a different era of education and need upgrades and repairs to meet today's safety and
educational standards. Student safety should always be a priority.
Measure B addresses these problems without increasing taxes by a single penny. Measure B will provide a
dedicated source of locally controlled funding that can only be used for improvements to our local schools.
