3.30.040 - Contract with state.
Prior to the operative date, the city shall contract with the California Department of Tax and Fee Administration to
perform all functions incident to the administration and operation of this transactions and use tax ordinance; provided, that
if the city shall not have contracted with the California Department of Tax and Fee Administration prior to the operative
date, it shall nevertheless so contract and in such a case the operative date shall be the first day of the first calendar
