Council-established priorities. This Measure authorized the financing of projects, and shall not be deemed to be an
approval of any "project" for purposes of the California Environmental Quality Act.
All of the purposes enumerated in this Measure shall constitute the specific purposes of the bonds, and proceeds of the
bonds shall be spent only for such purposes.
