This Impartial Analysis of Bond Measure Y has been prepared by County Counsel pursuant to Section 9500
of the California Elections Code.
This Measure was placed on the ballot by a resolution adopted by the Board of Trustees of the San Bernardino
Community College District (District). A "yes" vote by at least fifty-five percent of the voters voting on this Measure will
authorize the District to issue bonds in the amount of $898,000,000 to be used solely for the purposes set forth in this
ballot Measure. A "no" vote means that the District will not be authorized to issue and sell the $898,000,000 in bonds set
forth in the Measure.
